%table
  %caption Publication delay options
  %thead
    %tr
      %th{scope: "col"}
        %h3 File-Only Publication Delay
      %th{scope: "col"}
        %h3 Metadata and File Publication Delay
  %tbody
    %tr
      %td
        %h4 You receive an active DOI
        %p You receive a DOI and the link resolves to the Illinois Data Bank dataset record.
      %td
        %h4 Your DOI is saved, but the link will fail until release
        %p You can include the DOI in publications, but it will not resolve until the selected release date.
    %tr
      %td
        %h4 Your dataset record is discoverable
        %p Dataset metadata is publicly visible through Illinois Data Bank and search engines.
      %td
        %h4 Your dataset record is not discoverable
        %p Metadata and files remain hidden until the selected release date.
    %tr
      %td
        %h4 Dataset files cannot be accessed
        %p Files are unavailable until the selected release date even though the metadata record is visible.
      %td
        %h4 Dataset files cannot be accessed
        %p Neither metadata nor files are available until the selected release date.
